<title>USA: ECI Telecom names Kolber chairman.</title>
<headline>ECI Telecom names Kolber chairman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>ECI Telecom Ltd on Monday said that Jonathan Kolber has been appointed chairman of the company's board, effective April 15, 1997.</p>
<p>Kolber replaces Yoseph Rosen, who is resigning. Rosen will remain a member ECI's board.</p>
<p>Kolber has been president of Claridge Israel since 1989. Claridge Israel is a unit of Claridge Inc, a private investment company based in Montreal, an ECI spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>ECI, based in Petah Tikva, Israel, designs, develops, manufactures and markets digital telecommunications and data transmission systems.</p>
